$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=bmredlem  LOC_AFTER=?

* The induction step of ~ bmred : a further exceptional modulus ` u ` costs at most one prime factor of the reduced modulus (~ exprmfct ) and a factor 2 in the divisor counts (~ bmhalf ); ` u ` no longer divides the quotient because the modulus is squarefree (~ sqfpc , ~ pcmul , ~ pceq0 ).

